{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_node_census", "label": "The node census at the converged field (R81.6)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "For 7d and 8d no converged SCF exists \u2014 the channel the SCF would need is the one being searched for \u2014 so the field is borrowed from the row that does converge and nd is recorded at EVERY scan energy. A census answers whether the d ladder terminates at 3 nodes; a hit cannot.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_rydberg_objection", "label": "The Rydberg objection: a -1/r tail admits an infinite series in every l", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "With 88 electrons screening Z=89 the probe's asymptotic potential is -1/r, so l=2 must carry 7d, 8d, 9d... With a modest quantum defect those sit near -11.8 and -8.9 mHa, inside de81's searched window, and de81 found neither.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_three_hypotheses", "label": "H1 / H2 / H3 \u2014 convention, grid, or physics", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Either the tail is not -1/r for the probe (a convention: Vc = 0 and V floored at -q/r), or the radial grid cannot represent a state with <r> ~ 80 a0, or the d ladder genuinely terminates. H3 is what de81's result was written as though it had established and is the least likely of the three.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_third_class", "label": "A third class: outside the instrument's representable space", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "If the census saturates at nd=3 and the cause is the grid, 7d and 8d are neither absent nor unreached but unrepresentable \u2014 which is not what CLASS B means. The honest verdict is that R81.6's confirmation cannot be completed by this construction.", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_node_census", "target": "recovered_prediction_s81_item3_brackets_7d_8d", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_rydberg_objection", "target": "recovered_prediction_s81_item3_brackets_de81", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_rydberg_objection", "target": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_three_hypotheses", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_three_hypotheses", "target": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_third_class", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S82-ITEM4-CONVERGED-FIELD.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_prediction_s82_item4_converged_field_third_class", "target": "recovered_prediction_s77_item1_fchannels_class_b", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRA